      "region_id": "r12",
      "bbox": [
        454,
        1473,
        1081,
        134
      ],
      "text": "The mission of this trip required a number of meetings with theBrazilians who will conduct these projects. A summary of the finalproject protocol and the progress achieved to date is being prepared byDr. Reynolds.",
